  <sect2 role="installation">
    <title>Instalação do libgsf</title>

    <para>
      Instale <application>libgsf</application> executando os seguintes comandos:
    </para>

<!--
    Tests require infozip from unzip-6.0.  That package requires additional
    modifications for gcc-15.

    <para>

      To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>. 
      Two tests related to <xref linkend="valgrind"/> are known to fail.
    </para>
-->
<screen><userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;
make</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste funcional.
    </para>

    <para>
      Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class="username">root</systemitem>:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>make install</userinput></screen>

  </sect2>

